<p>By age 30 Miller had run commercial studios on both sides of the Atlanti=
c; taken a star turn in art cinema and become an haute couture icon; and mo=
ving on from Paris to Cairo, influenced Egyptian modern art while reinvigor=
ating her own work through travels in Egypt=E2=80=99s deserts.&nbsp;<br cla=
ss=3D"softbreak"></p>

